  },
  {
   "address": 26624,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The ceremony's sprites, pointers $A0 to $D7: the torch bearer running, the flame, and the doves' wingbeats."
  },
  {
   "address": 27648,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "More of the sprites."
  },
  {
   "address": 28672,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The flame's sprites, whose bytes $7080 and $7083 are rewritten at random to make it flicker."
  },
  {
   "address": 28800,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A byte of the flame, rewritten at random every frame."
  },
  {
   "address": 28803,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The other flickering byte, then the rest of the sprites."
  },
  {
   "address": 29696,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The last of the sprites."
  },
  {
   "address": 30208,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Entry: maps in the RAM under BASIC, sets the raster interrupt and the stadium, silences the SID, starts the tune, then waits for the tune to end or for a joystick to be let go and pressed again, and returns to the loader."
  },
  {
   "address": 30244,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The wait: a press counts only after one release, so a button still held from the menu does not skip the ceremony."
  },
  {
   "address": 30273,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The interrupt at line $FB: plays the tune, sets the eight sprites for the upper screen from the doves' table, then runs the step of the ceremony: the bearer running, the lighting, or the doves."
  },
  {
   "address": 30346,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "To the lighting."
  },
  {
   "address": 30349,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "To the bearer's last stretch."
  },
  {
   "address": 30352,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Turns on all the doves."
  },
  {
   "address": 30357,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Moves the torch bearer one pixel left; at x $4E starts the lighting, at x 0 the last stretch."
  },
  {
   "address": 30423,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Every four frames the next of the bearer's 14 running frames."
  },
  {
   "address": 30492,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "On the steps, between x $58 and $E4, lifts the bearer a pixel on the frames of the stride that push up."
  },
  {
   "address": 30523,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Places the bearer's sprites and the torch with him."
  },
  {
   "address": 30551,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Makes the flame flicker by writing random bytes into its sprite, and picks the flame's frame every eight frames."
  },
  {
   "address": 30602,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Each of the eight doves: climbs a line on its own delay, drifts right at its own speed, flaps through its wingbeat, and is turned off once above line $5C."
  },
  {
   "address": 30716,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Restores the registers and returns from the interrupt."
  },
  {
   "address": 30722,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The interrupt at line $6E: sets the eight sprites for the lower screen from the bearer's table."
  },
  {
   "address": 30796,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The lighting, five poses of the torch held up to the cauldron, each held a number of frames, then the doves fly."
  },
  {
   "address": 30931,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The doves fly and the bearer goes on."
  },
  {
   "address": 30945,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The bearer's last stretch: the flame's sprites only, the doves on."
  },
  {
   "address": 30958,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Turns off the CIA interrupts and sets the raster interrupt for line $FB, with the bitmap mode on."
  },
  {
   "address": 31000,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Shows the bitmap from bank $4000, copies its colours, and sets the sprites' starting places and colours."
  },
  {
   "address": 31303,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A random number from rnd and rnd_b."
  },
  {
   "address": 31319,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Silences the SID and sets three voices for the tune, with no tune playing."
  },
  {
   "address": 31380,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Starts tune Y when no tune, or one of a higher number, is playing."
  },
  {
   "address": 31401,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Each frame: counts down the step, releases the notes near its end, and at the next step sets the three voices' notes and the step's length; a byte of $80 or more ends the tune."
  },
  {
   "address": 31538,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The tunes' addresses: Y 0 for none and 2 for the ceremony's tune at $7B36."
  },
  {
   "address": 31539,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The tunes' addresses read one byte on, for the high bytes."
  },
  {
   "address": 31542,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The ceremony's tune, four bytes a step: three notes, one for each voice, and the step's length."
  },
  {
   "address": 31885,
